1:[[["$","link","css:/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css",{"rel":"stylesheet","precedence":"vite-rsc/importer-resources","href":"/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css","data-rsc-css-href":"/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css"}],"$undefined"],[[["$","link","css:/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css",{"rel":"stylesheet","precedence":"vite-rsc/importer-resources","href":"/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css","data-rsc-css-href":"/_next/static/css/page.Y1H9ouM5.css"}],"$undefined"],["$","$Lb",null,{"page":{"route":"/about","paragraphs":["Hi, it's Zack","I'm a Product/UX designer. I believe great design is felt before it is seen.","My interest in UX started with a strangely specific detail: book margins. They are not just empty space. They are designed so your fingers do not cover the text. That small moment changed how I think about design — the best experiences often come from decisions people barely notice.","That idea still shapes how I work today. I’ve designed across B2B SaaS, consumer growth, internal tools, HMI, grocery and travel. Different domains, same challenge: learn the logic, map the mess, and make the next step feel obvious.","My superpower is getting fluent fast — especially in complex products. I like learning the logic behind a system, finding my way through the messy parts, and turning confusion into clear design decisions.","I’m allergic to inefficiency. I like trying new tools, refining workflows, and making small changes that remove friction from everyday work. Figma is a good example. Somehow, I’ve helped teams move from Sketch to Figma twice. Now I’m doing the same thing with AI workflows — design faster, prototype quicker, and build small tools that save everybody's time.","Outside of design, I read manga, watch anime, take photos, and chase sunsets. I also spend way too much time planning trips and hunting for the best-value routes. Recently, I’ve been vibe-coding small tools, including one for manga translation and one for trip planning. I like building stuff around what I love.","I speak English and Mandarin, some French, and a little Japanese. I’m still learning — languages, tools, systems, and better ways to make things work."],"experiences":[{"company":"Sony","role":"Product design (sponsored project)","period":"01/2026 - 06/2026","summary":"Researched and designed for at-home sports viewing experiences, focusing on immersion."},{"company":"Alibaba","role":"Product design","period":"06/2025 - 08/2025","mobilePeriod":"06/2022 - 08/2024","summary":"Designed B2C grocery recommendation experiences and maintained design system."},{"company":"Accenture","role":"UX design (contract)","period":"08/2021 - 12/2021","summary":"Designed in-vehicle HMI experiences for Great Wall Motor."},{"company":"Zilliz","role":"Product design","period":"03/2021 - 06/2021","summary":"Designing for a vector database SaaS product at an early-stage startup."},{"company":"Ansys, Synopsys","role":"UX design","period":"08/2025 - 12/2025","summary":"Designed for a complex B2B SaaS simulation product used by mechanical engineers."},{"company":"Trip.com","role":"UX design","period":"06/2022 - 08/2024","summary":"Owned B2C and B2B car service & group tour experiences, focusing on conversion, growth, and operational efficiency.","mobileSummary":"Owned B2C and B2B car service experiences, focusing on conversion, growth, and operational efficiency."},{"company":"Bilibili","role":"Product design","period":"06/2021 - 08/2021","summary":"Designed live streaming platforms for streamers.","mobileSummary":"I designed live streaming platforms for streamers."}],"contact":{"headline":"Let's connect and touch grass sometime.","email":"zackw294@outlook.com"},"decorativeMedia":{"doodle":"/assets/media/S2yPcZhuQMHwRwPOFPDbbQOPo.png","footerImage":"/assets/media/96ajI6vK6AuYf1kjML705rB4.png"},"media":["/assets/media/0g1laHvRZVXCzLWMn86fcEdAys.jpeg","/assets/media/6xMJOGYJwe0KOVEzjW0mvcG0kUk.jpeg","/assets/media/8CbPPAf3Un7zuCb4YIbA3CRP8.jpeg","/assets/media/8IMe9nvF8fh4MbyUjMFYBmP6QY.jpeg","/assets/media/96ajI6vK6AuYf1kjML705rB4.png","/assets/media/BVB1pxdTE2eQ3loF5k9o6YCheY.jpeg","/assets/media/Pt4a2UKQqqNQRK9ACEjEJrSFIFs.jpeg","/assets/media/S2yPcZhuQMHwRwPOFPDbbQOPo.png","/assets/media/YU4tQJTGWVIw6JAIvuolkrXLTk.jpeg","/assets/media/dw14tVcy0sGOZHs64cNDlFZzaU.jpeg","/assets/media/q8QUSAamPVjaourKcjPljdnDDs.jpeg"]},"locale":"en"}]]]
